{"as_of":"2026-11-05","company":{"ticker":"SNDK","name":"Sandisk","sector":"Technology","industry":"Technology Hardware, Storage & Peripherals","size":"large","cik":2023554},"scores":{"growth":99.0,"quality":80.0,"value":93.0,"acceleration":100.0,"price_momentum":34.0,"reality":93.0,"pricing":14.0},"strategist":{"ticker":"SNDK","opportunity_score":73.0,"components":{"structural_trend":57.0,"capital_flow":22.0,"acceleration":100.0,"quality":80.0,"valuation":93.0,"estimate_revisions":null,"management_commentary":null,"narrative_acceleration":null,"insider_institutional":null},"weights":{"structural_trend":0.2,"capital_flow":0.1,"acceleration":0.15,"quality":0.15,"valuation":0.15,"estimate_revisions":0.1,"management_commentary":0.05,"narrative_acceleration":0.05,"insider_institutional":0.05},"coverage":0.75,"unavailable":{"estimate_revisions":"Estimate-revision feed (Phase 2)","management_commentary":"Earnings Intelligence Engine (Phase 2)","narrative_acceleration":"Narrative Intelligence Engine (Phase 2)","insider_institutional":"Form 4 / 13F ingestion (Phase 2)"},"reality":69.0,"narrative":35.0,"pricing":22.0,"expectations_gap":46.0,"macro_fit":49.0,"sector_rotation":-81.0,"theme_pricing":42.0,"checks":[{"label":"Revenue accelerating","ok":true,"evidence":"TTM growth +272.4% vs +175.3% prior quarter"},{"label":"FCF improving","ok":true,"evidence":"FCF growth +3265.3%, FCF margin +59.9%"},{"label":"ROIC expanding","ok":true,"evidence":"ROIC +164.7%, incremental ROIC +500.0%"},{"label":"Margins expanding","ok":true,"evidence":"Operating margin +72.5% (+9164 bps YoY)"},{"label":"Theme exposure strengthening","ok":false,"evidence":"Exposure-weighted theme trend 57.0"},{"label":"Capital rotating toward sector","ok":false,"evidence":"Technology rotation score -81"},{"label":"Valuation below own history","ok":false,"evidence":"Cheapness vs 5y history None/100"},{"label":"Valuation below sector peers","ok":true,"evidence":"Sector-relative value score 93.0"},{"label":"Balance sheet strong","ok":true,"evidence":"Net debt/EBITDA -0.2"},{"label":"Not diluting shareholders","ok":false,"evidence":"Diluted share count +7.0% YoY"},{"label":"Analyst estimates moving higher","ok":null,"evidence":"Estimate-revision feed not connected (Phase 2)"},{"label":"Management guidance increasing","ok":null,"evidence":"Earnings Intelligence Engine not built (Phase 2)"}],"thesis":"Sandisk (SNDK) screens at opportunity 73.0 with an expectations gap of 46.0. Reality 69.0 reflects +272.4% TTM revenue growth, +72.5% operating margin and +164.7% ROIC; pricing 22.0 reflects a depressed multiple and weak price momentum. Primary theme exposure: AI Infrastructure (trend 57.0). Macro fit for Technology in a Stagflation regime is 49.0/100.","market_expectation":{"summary":"Priced for stagnation or deterioration; the market is not paying for improvement.","evidence":["EV/Sales 4.3x","P/E 7x","FCF yield 13.3%","12m return +401%, -56% from 52w high"]},"what_market_misses":["Reality (69.0) is running ahead of what is priced (22.0): an expectations gap of +46 pts.","Revenue growth is accelerating (+272.4% TTM, +97.1 pts) while the multiple has not re-rated.","Operating leverage is showing up in margins faster than in the valuation."],"catalysts":["Next quarterly report (roughly 90 days after the last filing on 2026-10-30)","AI Infrastructure: evidence that 'GPU supply, power availability, cooling, network bandwidth' is easing via Accelerators, optical/electrical interconnect, HBM memory, liquid cooling, on-site power"],"risks":["Share count rising +7.0% YoY."],"thesis_break_conditions":["TTM revenue growth falls below 191% (currently 272.4%)","ROIC falls below 124% (currently 164.7%)","Operating margin YoY change falls below -2.0 pts (currently +91.6 pts)","Technology rotation score stays below -30 for two consecutive weeks (currently -81)","Adverse regime (Stagflation + Contraction) probability exceeds 55%","Price closes >10% below its 200-day average with negative relative strength","AI Infrastructure theme trend drops below 45 (currently 57.0)"],"break_rules":[{"id":"revenue_growth","label":"TTM revenue growth","metric":"revenue_growth","op":"<","threshold":1.9066,"current":2.7238},{"id":"roic","label":"ROIC","metric":"roic","op":"<","threshold":1.2354,"current":1.6472},{"id":"margin","label":"Operating margin change YoY","metric":"operating_margin_change","op":"<","threshold":-0.02,"current":0.9163949518173434},{"id":"rotation","label":"Technology rotation score","metric":"sector_rotation","op":"<","threshold":-30,"consecutive_weeks":2,"current":-81.0},{"id":"regime","label":"P(Stagflation)+P(Contraction)","metric":"adverse_regime_prob","op":">","threshold":55,"current":51.7},{"id":"trend","label":"Distance from 200dma","metric":"dist_200dma","op":"<","threshold":-10,"and_negative_rs":true,"current":-18.2},{"id":"theme","label":"AI Infrastructure theme trend","metric":"theme_trend","theme_id":"ai-infrastructure","op":"<","threshold":45,"current":57.0}],"narrative_note":"Narrative from the last 7 morning briefs' theme signals (exposure-weighted).","llm_enriched":true,"theme_exposures":[{"theme_id":"ai-infrastructure","theme":"AI Infrastructure","weight":0.5,"order":1,"effective":0.5}],"llm":{"thesis":"Sandisk is exhibiting extreme operating leverage\u2014revenue growth accelerating to +272% TTM, operating margin expanding over 9,100bps YoY, and ROIC north of 164%\u2014while trading at just 8x earnings and a 10.6% FCF yield, a valuation profile the market reserves for decliners, not accelerators. The stock has already repriced violently (-51% from 52-week highs, -36% in the last month alone) despite fundamentals still improving, suggesting a disconnect between near-term price action and underlying business momentum. This looks like a classic post-momentum-crash dislocation in an AI-infrastructure-adjacent memory/storage name: the market is pricing stagnation (pricing score 28) while reality (72) says otherwise. The risk is that this is a cyclical memory upcycle being mistaken for a structural re-rating, and technology sector rotation is firmly negative, meaning any re-rating will fight the tape. Timing is the central question\u2014fundamentals support the bull case, but technicals are in clear breakdown mode with no confirmed bottom yet.","fundamental_read":"Revenue is compounding at a +272% TTM clip with positive acceleration (+97pts QoQ), driving operating margin to ~72.5% (+9,164bps YoY) and ROIC to 165%, with incremental ROIC near 500%\u2014indicative of a business riding a sharp cyclical upswing, likely NAND/flash pricing or AI-driven storage demand. FCF conversion is strong (89%) and the balance sheet is net-cash with zero debt, giving full flexibility. The only blemish is +7% YoY share dilution, which modestly offsets per-share value creation, and the lack of multi-year valuation history context (cheapness vs 5y history is unscored) limits confidence this margin level is sustainable rather than peak-cycle.","technical_read":"The stock is in a confirmed downtrend on the intermediate timeframe\u2014below its 20/50/200-day averages after a violent -13.5% single-day drop on 2x average volume, with RSI at 33 (approaching oversold but not yet a reversal signal) and MACD solidly negative. The 50-day is still above the 200-day (nominal uptrend structure), but price is 8.6% below the 200-day with negative relative strength, meeting one of the stated thesis-break conditions; this is a falling-knife setup, not a basing pattern yet.","market_expectation":"At 8x P/E, 5.5x EV/Sales, and a 10.6% FCF yield, the market is pricing SNDK as if its current growth and margin levels are transient or about to mean-revert sharply\u2014essentially underwriting a cyclical peak-and-decline scenario rather than durable AI-infrastructure-driven demand. The extreme momentum reversal (+463% 12-month return now down 51% from highs) suggests the market initially over-extrapolated the upcycle and is now swinging to pricing a hard reset, with technology sector rotation at -58 reinforcing capital flight rather than rotation into the name.","what_market_misses":["Reality (72) is running far ahead of pricing (28)\u2014a 44-point expectations gap, with no sign yet that revenue acceleration or margin expansion has reversed.","The business is net-cash, debt-free, and converting ~89% of earnings to free cash flow, giving resilience the sharp price decline does not reflect.","Sector-relative valuation (90/100) shows SNDK is cheap even against beaten-down tech peers, not just in isolation."],"catalysts":["Next quarterly report (~90 days post 2026-10-30 filing) to confirm whether revenue acceleration and margin expansion persist or decelerate","Evidence that AI infrastructure bottlenecks (GPU supply, power, cooling, bandwidth) are easing via memory/storage demand (HBM, interconnect, liquid cooling) could reinforce the structural narrative","A stabilization in technology sector rotation (currently -58) or reversal of the stagflation regime could unlock capital flow back into the name"],"risks":["Share dilution running +7% YoY erodes per-share economics even as aggregate fundamentals improve.","Current margin/ROIC levels may reflect a cyclical memory-pricing peak rather than durable structural improvement, given no multi-year valuation history context is available.","Technical breakdown (below 200dma, negative RSI/MACD, 2x volume selloff) signals the market may have information or flow dynamics not captured in the fundamental data.","Stagflation regime (34% probability, highest of four) paired with -58 technology rotation creates a persistent headwind to re-rating regardless of fundamentals.","12-month return of +463% followed by a -51% drawdown suggests this may be unwinding a speculative overshoot rather than offering a clean value entry."],"thesis_break_conditions":["TTM revenue growth falls below 191% (currently 272.4%)","ROIC falls below 124% (currently 164.7%)","Operating margin YoY change falls below -2.0 pts (currently +91.6 pts)","Technology rotation score stays below -30 for two consecutive weeks (currently -58)","Adverse regime (Stagflation + Contraction) probability exceeds 55%","Price closes >10% below its 200-day average with negative relative strength (currently -8.6%, close to triggering)","AI Infrastructure theme trend drops below 45 (currently 57.0)"],"second_order_beneficiaries":["Memory/storage equipment and testing suppliers who benefit from SNDK's capacity expansion if the upcycle is capex-driven","Interconnect and packaging providers (optical/electrical interconnect, HBM memory ecosystem) tied to the same AI infrastructure theme SNDK is exposed to","Competing NAND/flash producers who benefit from the same pricing upcycle dynamics (industry-wide margin tailwind, not SNDK-specific)","Cooling and power infrastructure providers if elevated storage/compute demand is driving the margin expansion seen across the AI infrastructure theme"],"epistemic_labels":[{"statement":"TTM revenue growth is +272.4% vs +175.3% prior quarter","kind":"observed_fact"},{"statement":"Operating margin expanded +9,164 bps YoY to 72.5%","kind":"observed_fact"},{"statement":"ROIC is 164.7% with incremental ROIC of 500%","kind":"observed_fact"},{"statement":"Stock is down 51% from 52-week high and fell 13.5% in a single day on 2x volume","kind":"observed_fact"},{"statement":"Diluted share count rose 7.0% YoY","kind":"observed_fact"},{"statement":"Technology sector rotation score is -58, the second-worst of all sectors tracked","kind":"observed_fact"},{"statement":"Market is pricing stagnation or deterioration rather than paying for improvement","kind":"ai_inference"},{"statement":"The expectations gap of 44 points represents a genuine mispricing rather than a justified discount for cyclicality","kind":"ai_inference"},{"statement":"Current margin and ROIC levels may reflect a cyclical NAND/memory pricing peak rather than durable structural improvement","kind":"speculative_hypothesis"},{"statement":"A stabilization in technology sector rotation would unlock capital flow back into SNDK","kind":"speculative_hypothesis"},{"statement":"Next quarterly report will confirm continued revenue acceleration and margin expansion","kind":"consensus_expectation"}],"confidence":0.47,"_model":"claude-sonnet-5"},"llm_from":"2026-11-02"},"technical":{"score":50,"passes":4,"criteria":{"above_150_200":false,"150_above_200":true,"200_rising_1m":true,"50_above_150_200":true,"above_50":false,"25pct_above_52w_low":true,"within_25pct_of_52w_high":false,"rs_positive_6m":false},"ready":false,"stage":"basing_or_downtrend","close":1037.4,"sma50":1531.29,"sma150":1487.02,"sma200":1268.98,"sma150_prev4w":1397.29,"sma150_declining":false,"pct_above_52w_low":433.7,"pct_from_52w_high":-55.6,"rs_6m":-27.4,"rsi14":30.7,"atr20":97.587,"atr_pct":9.41,"overbought":false},"pm":{"entry":{"score":58.0,"label":"hold / watch","components":{"fundamentals":73.0,"valuation":75.0,"momentum":28.0,"catalyst":57.0,"regime":49.0,"flows":32.0},"weights":{"fundamentals":0.3,"valuation":0.2,"momentum":0.2,"catalyst":0.15,"regime":0.1,"flows":0.05}},"expected_return":{"price":1037.4,"bear":881.79,"base":2917.27,"bull":3938.31,"prob":[0.3,0.5,0.2],"expected_value":2510.83,"expected_return_pct":142.0,"band":"accumulate","upside_base_pct":181.2,"downside_bear_pct":-15.0,"n_methods":4,"score":75.0,"confidence":"low","method":"normalised metrics (half current, half 8-quarter median) x blended own/sector multiples (60/40) capped at 2x sector; LOW CONFIDENCE: model fair value is more than 60% above the price, so the market is pricing a de-rating the multiples do not capture (score capped at 75)"},"momentum":{"returns":{"1m":-37.5,"3m":-17.6,"6m":-26.4,"12m":401.1},"relative":{"spy":{"3m":-17.3,"6m":-30.9},"sector":{"3m":-12.8,"6m":-30.2}},"checks":{"above_200dma":false,"50_above_200":true,"rs_3m_vs_spy_positive":false,"rs_6m_vs_spy_positive":false,"12m_positive":true,"rs_3m_vs_sector_posit